{"shortDescription":"U.S. President Donald Trump executed 517 securities trades in August totaling $74.3M to $273M, driven by large reallocations into Big Tech giants like Meta Platforms NASDAQ:META, Microsoft NASDAQ:MSFT, and Netflix NASDAQ:NFLX alongside a targeted debt position in SpaceX NASDAQ:SPCX directly ahead o…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["U.S. President Donald Trump executed 517 securities trades in August totaling $74.3M to $273M, driven by large reallocations into Big Tech giants like Meta Platforms ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:META","text":"NASDAQ:META"}},", Microsoft ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:MSFT","text":"NASDAQ:MSFT"}},", and Netflix ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:NFLX","text":"NASDAQ:NFLX"}}," alongside a targeted debt position in SpaceX ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:SPCX","text":"NASDAQ:SPCX"}}," directly ahead of a major space policy signing, according to a new financial disclosure released Thursday."]},{"type":"p","children":["While trading cooled down relative to June and July—months that each ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4645797-trump-july-disclosure-1156-trades-microsoft-and-amazon-among-largest-sales?utm_source=tradingview\u0026utm_medium=referral\u0026feed_item_type=news","linkText":"saw"}}," over 1K disclosures—Trump's portfolio still maintained a high level of activity."]},{"type":"p","children":["The August disclosure shows significant activity across individual equities, led by a major portfolio reshuffling on Aug. 21. The anchor transaction of the month was a purchase of between $5M and $25M in Meta ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:META","text":"NASDAQ:META"}}," stock. On the same day, Trump acquired $1M to $5M worth of shares in Netflix ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:NFLX","text":"NASDAQ:NFLX"}},", AT\u0026T ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:T","text":"NYSE:T"}},", ConocoPhillips ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:COP","text":"NYSE:COP"}},", Abbott Laboratories ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:ABT","text":"NYSE:ABT"}},", and Chevron ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:CVX","text":"NYSE:CVX"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Aug. 21 push also featured mid-tier equity investments ranging from $500,001 to $1M in major tech and industrial names, including Nvidia ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:NVDA","text":"NASDAQ:NVDA"}},", Advanced Micro Devices ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:AMD","text":"NASDAQ:AMD"}},", Datadog ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:DDOG","text":"NASDAQ:DDOG"}},", Dell Technologies ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:DELL","text":"NYSE:DELL"}},", Palo Alto Networks ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:PANW","text":"NASDAQ:PANW"}},", T-Mobile ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:TMUS","text":"NASDAQ:TMUS"}},", Boeing ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:BA","text":"NYSE:BA"}},", Home Depot ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:HD","text":"NYSE:HD"}},", and Church \u0026 Dwight ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:CHD","text":"NYSE:CHD"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":["Notably, on Aug. 18, Trump purchased $1M to $5M in senior unsecured notes issued by Elon Musk’s SpaceX ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:SPCX","text":"NASDAQ:SPCX"}},". The corporate debt carries a 5.35% yield and matures in July 2031. The transaction occurred just a couple of days before Trump ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4635754-trump-targets-1000-annual-us-space-launches-by-2030?utm_source=tradingview\u0026utm_medium=referral\u0026feed_item_type=news","linkText":"signed a policy directive"}}," aimed at expanding commercial space transportation."]},{"type":"p","children":["Earlier in the month, Trump accumulated $1M to $5M positions in Microsoft ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:MSFT","text":"NASDAQ:MSFT"}},", McDonald's ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:MCD","text":"NYSE:MCD"}},", and Comcast ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:CMCSA","text":"NASDAQ:CMCSA"}}," on Aug. 10, following earlier August purchases in Nvidia ($250K to $500K) and IBM ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:IBM","text":"NYSE:IBM"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":["Late-August buying continued across specialized growth sectors, with additions in AI server maker Super Micro Computer ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:SMCI","text":"NASDAQ:SMCI"}},", eVTOL startup Joby Aviation ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:JOBY","text":"NYSE:JOBY"}},", nuclear energy firm Oklo Inc ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:OKLO","text":"NYSE:OKLO"}},", cloud infrastructure provider CoreWeave ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:CRWV","text":"NASDAQ:CRWV"}},", Uber ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:UBER","text":"NYSE:UBER"}},", Oracle ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:ORCL","text":"NYSE:ORCL"}},", Tesla ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:TSLA","text":"NASDAQ:TSLA"}},", and Palantir Technologies ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:PLTR","text":"NASDAQ:PLTR"}},", the filing showed."]},{"type":"p","children":["On the other side of the fence, Trump offloaded some positions across retail, consumer goods, and technology. Larger block sales executed on Aug. 28 included $100K to $250K divestments in TJX Companies ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:TJX","text":"NYSE:TJX"}}," and Intuitive Surgical ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:ISRG","text":"NASDAQ:ISRG"}},". He also trimmed positions valued between $50K and $100K in Walmart ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:WMT","text":"NASDAQ:WMT"}}," and Lowe's ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:LOW","text":"NYSE:LOW"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"disclaimer","children":["Content provided by Seeking Alpha is intended for information purposes only, and that Seeking Alpha does not offer any personalist investment advice and is not a licensed securities dealer, broker, US investment adviser or investment bank."]}]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"Corporate bonds","args":[{"id":"category","value":"corp_bond"}]},{"title":"Seeking Alpha","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"seekingalpha"}]},{"title":"US stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"US"}]}],"canonical_link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4651382-trumps-top-august-trades-include-meta-spacex-att-buys-among-others?utm_source=tradingview\u0026utm_medium=referral\u0026feed_item_type=news","id":"seekingalpha:1e912377c094b:0","title":"Trump's top August trades include Meta, SpaceX, AT\u0026T buys, among others","published":1791469907,"urgency":2,"link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4651382-trumps-top-august-trades-include-meta-spacex-att-buys-among-others?utm_source=tradingview\u0026utm_medium=referral\u0026feed_item_type=news","relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"NASDAQ:META","logoid":"meta-platforms","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"meta-platforms"}},{"symbol":"NASDAQ:MSFT","logoid":"microsoft","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"microsoft"}},{"symbol":"NASDAQ:NFLX","logoid":"netflix","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"netflix"}},{"symbol":"NASDAQ:SPCX","logoid":"spacex","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"spacex"}},{"symbol":"NYSE:T","logoid":"at-and-t","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"at-and-t"}},{"symbol":"NYSE:COP","logoid":"conocophillips","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"conocophillips"}},{"symbol":"NYSE:ABT","logoid":"abbott","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"abbott"}},{"symbol":"NYSE:CVX","logoid":"chevron","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"chevron"}},{"symbol":"NASDAQ:NVDA","logoid":"nvidia","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"nvidia"}},{"symbol":"NASDAQ:AMD","logoid":"advanced-micro-devices","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"advanced-micro-devices"}},{"symbol"